{"componentChunkName":"component---src-pages-new-projects-js","path":"new-projects/marina-bay-damac-properties-al-reem-island","result":{"serverData":{"data":{"status":true,"message":"Property details fetch successfully","data":{"id":327,"crm_id":"2245","search_type":"sales","department":"new_developments","status":"pending","title":"Marina Bay","slug":"marina-bay-damac-properties-al-reem-island","display_address":"Al Reem Island","building_type":["apartment","townhouse"],"completion_year":"Ready ","developer":"Damac Properties","price":3559500,"display_price":"3.55M","lattitude":24.492667,"longitude":54.3695233,"min_bedrooms":1,"max_bedrooms":3,"display_bedrooms":null,"about":"<p>Marina Bay is a 25-storey luxury residential development by Damac Properties located in the heart of Abu Dhabi on Al Reem Island. This project is a perfect blend of modern design, high technology and first-class amenities.</p><p>Marina Bay features elegant <strong>1-3 bedroom apartments</strong> and cozy townhouses with practical functional layouts and panoramic windows offering breathtaking views of the Arabian Gulf and the cityscape. Commercial spaces are located on the first floor.</p><p>The complex offers residents modern amenities, including 24-hour security and concierge desk, swimming pools, fitness centers with modern equipment, picturesque landscaped gardens, spa complexes, restaurants and cafes - all this creates an ideal environment for living, recreation and entertainment.</p><p>The interior of the apartments are decorated with attention to every detail, in the finishing used high quality materials, thanks to which each house reigns cozy and peaceful atmosphere.</p><p>The location of Marina Bay on Al Reem Island allows residents to quickly get to the main places of social and entertainment infrastructure of the city. The beautiful beach is 300 meters away, and Abu Dhabi International Airport is just a 30-minute drive away.</p><p>Marina Bay is an ideal choice for those looking for a modern, comfortable lifestyle close to the sea. The complex will also suit couples with children, and investors can earn a stable income from renting out apartments for long and short term real estate.</p>","tile_image":null,"banner_image":null,"media_images":null,"images":[{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/off-plan/2245/images/2024/06/25/rv0FMHS5NQl5sVhHX4FgVdijynU03ylDv4rQnb3N.jpg","srcUrl":"https://cdn.geniemap.net/2024/06/25/rv0FMHS5NQl5sVhHX4FgVdijynU03ylDv4rQnb3N.jpg","__ggfxIndex":0},{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/off-plan/2245/images/2024/06/19/m2pgtNU9e0P7Kd0kpsAdCDw57O60EEYNCXdwfpqb.jpg","srcUrl":"https://cdn.geniemap.net/2024/06/19/m2pgtNU9e0P7Kd0kpsAdCDw57O60EEYNCXdwfpqb.jpg","__ggfxIndex":1},{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/off-plan/2245/images/2024/06/19/8py45dJRYLzUXV6TL1vDCaWZ2Nqio4qR2I5FoXkY.jpg","srcUrl":"https://cdn.geniemap.net/2024/06/19/8py45dJRYLzUXV6TL1vDCaWZ2Nqio4qR2I5FoXkY.jpg","__ggfxIndex":2}],"characteristics_module":null,"location_tile":null,"brochure":{"id":2690,"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/2024/06/19/T9p4QOCwd93eAsF4qVsP0PA3SCzgYyhtoEkvxbYa.pdf","file":null,"item":[],"image":null},"video_module":null,"floor_plans":[{"id":2468,"url":null,"area":null,"size":null,"media":null,"title":"1 Bedroom Apartment","kitchen":null,"parking":null,"flooring":null,"ceiling_height":null,"starting_price":null},{"id":2469,"url":null,"area":null,"size":null,"media":null,"title":"2 Bedroom Apartment","kitchen":null,"parking":null,"flooring":null,"ceiling_height":null,"starting_price":null},{"id":2470,"url":null,"area":null,"size":null,"media":null,"title":"3 Bedroom Apartment","kitchen":null,"parking":null,"flooring":null,"ceiling_height":null,"starting_price":null}],"payment_plan_text":"","payment_plans":[],"community":"","publish":1,"currency":"","amenities":[],"bitrix":{"id":952,"pf_id":"are.3.5524","source":null,"pr